<p data-start="108" data-end="229" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Following the review of your proposal, we request you to please address the modifications based on the comments below:</p><p data-start="108" data-end="229" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!IndividualApplication.WIN_Approval_Comments__c}</p><p data-start="108" data-end="229" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Kindly revise and resubmit your proposal after incorporating the required changes by&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!IndividualApplication.Due_Date_for_Resubmission_WIN__c}.</font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">For clarifications, please contact&nbsp;<o:p></o:p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">win.support@wadhwanifoundation.org</span></p>

